<step1>
<ptxt>Inspect Steering Lock Actuator (Steering Lock ECU)</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the battery voltage with the IG ON.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the voltage and resistance between the terminals of the steering lock ECU, or between the terminals and body ground.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030、09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten3>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back side of the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C104383J55" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</atten3>
</step2>
